WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Cards support the battle as enemies take damage.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Victory opens a choice of card rewards.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:49.000
The updated map shows the deck and an inspected card.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:55.960
The selected card burns, leaving a benefit for the next battle.
